    "title": "Belfast News-Letter, 18 October 1946, p. 6 (\"Portstewart\"); Londonderry Sentinel, 19 October 1946, p. 6 (\"Portstewart Urban District Council\"); Belfast News-Letter, 2 October 1946, p. 6 (\"Portstewart nominations\")",
    "publisher": "Belfast News-Letter (via the Irish Newspaper Archives)",
    "kind": "news",
    "check": "Votes from BNL 18 Oct 1946 p6 ('Seventy-five per cent of the electorate voted at Portstewart, where there were 16 candidates for 12 seats ... Not elected - William Burke, 290; David N. Milligan, 258; C. E. Black, 246; H. J. Black, 235'); the same figures read in the Londonderry Sentinel page image (19 Oct 1946 p6), which marks the eight outgoing members. Full names from the nominations (BNL 2 Oct 1946 p6). No party labels printed.",
